      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/magic/perception/eye-ringed-glow-angry-small-teal.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Orange T perceives invisible creatures, objects and planar boundaries within 60 feet. He pointed at something in the sanctum and laughed when Bowser could not see it. He did not explain what it was.</p>",
