    {
      "_id": "KJFstRHBteekogrc",
      "name": "A Future Nobody Has Audited",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/magic/light/explosion-star-glow-orange.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Not a usable ability. A note for the DM.</strong> The archive records that the Toad once known as Orange T later used a Star Fragment to become a warping divinity, allied with Fawful, and that the Mages' Guild wants him captured — 'just get Orange T'. That entity is the <em>God Toad</em>, and it has its own record, its own XP entry and its own artifacts. None of that power is on this sheet. This is the Toad before the fragment.</p>",
          "chat": "Every file ends. This one stops."
        },
